      "instance_name": "photoshop",
      "label": "Photoshop",
      "description": "Photoshop is a widely used raster graphics editor developed by Adobe Inc., commonly used for photo editing, digital art, and image manipulation. The meme references the act of 'photoshopping' — digitally altering an image — which is a common practice in online culture, often used humorously or critically. Understanding that 'photoshopping' refers to digital image editing is essential to comprehend the meme’s accusation against the creator of the image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
