      "instance_name": "cyberbullying",
      "label": "Cyberbullying",
      "description": "Cyberbullying is the use of digital communication to harass, threaten, or humiliate someone. The meme’s accusatory tone and intent to shame the creator align with cyberbullying behaviors, even if the target is not a specific community or identity group. The image’s visual metaphor of being surrounded by pointing hands is a common representation of being targeted in online harassment.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
