      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "internet_meme_culture",
      "label": "Internet Meme Culture",
      "description": "Internet meme culture refers to the widespread sharing and modification of images, videos, or text with humorous or satirical intent, often to comment on current events or social issues. The meme format — combining a visual image with text to convey a message — is a hallmark of internet meme culture. Understanding this context helps explain why the meme is structured the way it is and why it resonates with online audiences.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
